{"4669260": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Cold Engine", "steam_appid": 4669260, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4768260], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Cold Engine you are assigned to a train, a debt, and a quota. Choose routes, deliver cargo, manage heat and energy, and keep moving through a frozen system that values the process more than the operator. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4669260/extras/8f6b2f61df5b300beb76206e89f276e7.poster.avif?t=1787767307\" width=1170 height=700 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4669260/extras/8f6b2f61df5b300beb76206e89f276e7.webm?t=1787767307\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4669260/extras/8f6b2f61df5b300beb76206e89f276e7.mp4?t=1787767307\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accept contracts, choose routes, and transport sealed cargo between isolated stations.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each delivery pays toward your debt — if enough of the cargo survives the trip.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4669260/extras/3dc6ca401d0a2fb53fe5a1ab5fbad4fe.poster.avif?t=1787767307\" width=1170 height=700 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4669260/extras/3dc6ca401d0a2fb53fe5a1ab5fbad4fe.webm?t=1787767307\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4669260/extras/3dc6ca401d0a2fb53fe5a1ab5fbad4fe.mp4?t=1787767307\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The train is your shelter, your workplace, and your life support.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep the engine running, the temperature stable, and enough power left to reach the next station.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4669260/extras/56c27b7903bf866a883feded4d533960.poster.avif?t=1787767307\" width=1170 height=700 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4669260/extras/56c27b7903bf866a883feded4d533960.webm?t=1787767307\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4669260/extras/56c27b7903bf866a883feded4d533960.mp4?t=1787767307\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A stronger train means longer routes, heavier cargo, and fewer excuses.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invest carefully: repairs, upgrades, and quota payments all compete for the same money.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4669260/extras/665a5fac8ab2306c01d9ee7655e6aeb4.avif?t=1787767307\" width=305 height=95 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Complete the delivery and move forward.  Debt can shrink, quotas return, and the next route is already waiting.</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Cold Engine you are assigned to a train, a debt, and a quota. Choose routes, deliver cargo, manage heat and energy, and keep moving through a frozen system that values the process more than the operator. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4669260/extras/8f6b2f61df5b300beb76206e89f276e7.poster.avif?t=1787767307\" width=1170 height=700 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4669260/extras/8f6b2f61df5b300beb76206e89f276e7.webm?t=1787767307\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4669260/extras/8f6b2f61df5b300beb76206e89f276e7.mp4?t=1787767307\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accept contracts, choose routes, and transport sealed cargo between isolated stations.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each delivery pays toward your debt — if enough of the cargo survives the trip.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4669260/extras/3dc6ca401d0a2fb53fe5a1ab5fbad4fe.poster.avif?t=1787767307\" width=1170 height=700 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4669260/extras/3dc6ca401d0a2fb53fe5a1ab5fbad4fe.webm?t=1787767307\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4669260/extras/3dc6ca401d0a2fb53fe5a1ab5fbad4fe.mp4?t=1787767307\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The train is your shelter, your workplace, and your life support.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep the engine running, the temperature stable, and enough power left to reach the next station.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4669260/extras/56c27b7903bf866a883feded4d533960.poster.avif?t=1787767307\" width=1170 height=700 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4669260/extras/56c27b7903bf866a883feded4d533960.webm?t=1787767307\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4669260/extras/56c27b7903bf866a883feded4d533960.mp4?t=1787767307\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A stronger train means longer routes, heavier cargo, and fewer excuses.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invest carefully: repairs, upgrades, and quota payments all compete for the same money.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4669260/extras/665a5fac8ab2306c01d9ee7655e6aeb4.avif?t=1787767307\" width=305 height=95 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Complete the delivery and move forward.  Debt can shrink, quotas return, and the next route is already waiting.</strong></p>", "short_description": "Operate a corporate train through a world of endless cold. Choose your routes, deliver mysterious cargo, upgrade your train, and make hard decisions to survive the storms, meet the quota, and chase the next promise that the system will let you go.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4669260/56b2f274c291ba141887f213439b3604e9baf2ae/header.jpg?t=1787767307", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4669260/8900c670ee11e770a5d7c225501a4767defcc021/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787767307", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4669260/8900c670ee11e770a5d7c225501a4767defcc021/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787767307", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong>